                <pb facs="0225" n="117" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg117"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr.
                            Thompson.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-02-01"><hi rendition="#italic">February 1,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Gresham states that Admiral Benham has acted within his instructions; and
                    that it is therefore hoped that Mr. Thompson, whose telegram is satisfactory, is
                    in accord with the admiral.</p>
            </div>
